            <div class="skills__tags skills__tags--competencies">
              <span class="skills__tag">Scalable System &amp; Application Architecture</span>
              <span class="skills__tag">Frontend Architecture &amp; Performance Engineering</span>
              <span class="skills__tag">AI-Driven Application Development &amp; Intelligent Automation</span>
              <span class="skills__tag">Full-Stack Product Engineering</span>
